GRAMMAR.md §7.1 (DECISIONS 332): optional_roots names a root project.canon does not declare, and a root twice; it may come before roots.
-- project.canon --
project acme {
  canon: "0.1"
  optional_roots: [source, client, source]
  roots {
    source: "../Source"
  }
}
-- findings.txt --
error[E1009]  project.canon:3:28
  optional_roots: "client" is not a declared root

error[E1009]  project.canon:3:36
  optional_roots: "source" is listed twice

2 errors, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
